</div></section>



</div><div id="shopify-section-template--22541857423605__0392b98f-45f7-4b76-85a4-fe3869480d5f" class="shopify-section">
<section class="rich-text container">
  <div class="rich-text__inner">
    <div class="subheader"></div>
    <div class="rich-text_copy rich-text__h1">We believe in thoughtful design and cultivating conversations. It’s at the core of everything we do—the starting point of all our makeup, skincare, bodycare, and fragrance products. At Glossier, beauty is about celebrating freedom of expression, individuality , and having fun. Our Skin First. Makeup Second™ approach ensures that every product supports your skin’s health, allowing your makeup to enhance rather than mask your natural beauty.</div>
    
  </div>
</section>
