<h2 class="media-text__heading">
              Explore Glossier
            </h2><div class="media-text__description rte">
              <p>Now that you’re here, take a look around. Mingle with our products, and enjoy. Because no matter where you are in your beauty journey—YOU LOOK GOOD. Discover products that prioritize your skin’s wellbeing while allowing your individuality to shine through. Skin First. Makeup Second™. </p><p></p>
            </div><div class="media-text__ctas"><a class="btn btn--a btn--primary marching-ants" href="/en-in/collections/bestsellers" title="/en-in/collections/bestsellers" data-testid="mediaTextPrimaryCTA" data-section-title="">
                Shop Bestsellers
              </a></div></div>
        
